EN:
Not to burst your bubble,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} but shoo!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}
I'm in town to conduct business, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}not
sign your autograph book, darling.

IT:
Non te la prendere,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} ma... sciò!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}
Sono qui per affari, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}non per firmare
autografi, tesoro!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Seni burada görmek de ne hoş
sürpriz, şekerim!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Biraz etrafı mı geziyorsun?

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Hello there.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Are you a native of this little town?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Yes!
Nope.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Merhaba.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Bu küçük kasabanın yerlisi misin?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Evet!
Hayır.

{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Bak sen,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}sen! Daha önce
karşılaşmışız gibi bir his var,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
gece geçen iki gemi gibi. Söyle
bakalım şekerim,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} bu kasabada mı
yaşıyorsun?{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} Evet, değil mi!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
Üzerinde resmen {{TAG:0005:0005:}} yazıyor.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}¡No me sirves para nada!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Además,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} se ve a la legua que a ti
no te interesa la moda{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:000D:0008:02CD}}{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Igual sí que me interesa
Venga, pues hasta otra

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Ti serve qualcos'altro? {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Davvero
non ho tempo da perdere con un{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}
a cui non interessa la moda...{{TAG:000D:0008:02CD}}{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Forse mi interessa...
OK, ciao!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Il faudrait savoir ce que tu veux !{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
OK, je te crois sur parole.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Tu as intérêt à faire de ton mieux,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
car à travers toi, c'est l'honneur de
toute la ville qui est en jeu !

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}It's been a while!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Have you brushed up your fashion
sense since we last met, darling?

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}È una vita che non ti vedo!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Nel frattempo, hai migliorato
il tuo gusto in fatto di moda?

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}It's been too long!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
I hope you've spent all that time
polishing your sense of style.

{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Don't you sound confident!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Well, I happen to have a spare
moment, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}so let's get started.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}¡No te veo muy segur{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Bueno,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
me pillas ahora que tengo un
momento libre, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}así que vamos allá.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ne kadar da kendinden eminsin!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Neyse, şu an biraz boş vaktim
var,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} başlayalım.

EN:
Oh, it's you again.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
What do you want?{{TAG:000D:0008:02CD}}{{TAG:000F:0006:000000000000}}
Revenge!
What's the theme?
Nothing...

TRANSLATION:
Aa, yine sen.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Ne istiyorsun?{{TAG:000D:0008:02CD}}{{TAG:000F:0006:000000000000}}
Rövanş!
Tema neydi?
Hiçbir şey...

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Then why are you bothering me?{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
Darling, I am swamped today, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}so
puh-lease stay out of my way!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Allora perché mi importuni?{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
Tesoro, sono sommersa di impegni,
{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}quindi levati di torno!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}The first rule of fashion is to
always have room in your pockets.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Go clear those things out, darling!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}La règle numéro un de tout amateur
de mode, c'est d'avoir de la place
dans ses poches, darling !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}La prima regola della moda è avere
sempre spazio nelle tasche.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Cerca di svuotarle un po', tesoro.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Etwas mehr Dankbarkeit, bitte!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Das ist schließlich {{TAG:000E:0002:}}
{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}!
Dass dir nicht im Traume einfällt,
dieses Stück weiterzuverkaufen!
{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Capito?

TRANSLATION:
Bu keşif gezisi başarılı geçti,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
ama henüz karar veremiyorum.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Yine geleceğim!

EN:
Time to get back to the grindstone.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
And by grindstone, I mean my design
studio.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}} No rest for the weary!

TRANSLATION:
Yeniden iş başına dönme zamanı.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
İş başı derken tasarım stüdyomu
kastediyorum.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}} Çalışana dinlenmek yok!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Niente ti impedisce di riprovarci.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Ma la prossima volta, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}ti consiglio
di metterci più impegno, tesoro!

TRANSLATION:
Yeniden deneyeceksen çabuk gel.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Saat gece yarısını vurunca
buradan giderim!
